  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1502.06 Railroad Company Railroad Tax Payment Form. All railroads shall, annually on or before 30 days from the date of the notice of valuation issued by the department, make payment of any remaining balance shown to be due on the notice using the payment voucher provided on the notice.\n\nSource. #8652, eff 6-6-06; ss by #10662, eff 8-27-14; ss by #12165, eff 4-29-17; ss by #13490, eff 11-15-22; ss by #13977, eff 5-23-24",
